Z||000000||overlord||11-24-2001||10:23 PM||||was just wondering if there is someway i can run a cord throgh the fireall.<P>I want to install an interior car warmer for the winter months, would like the cord to go out the rear where my block heeater cord is.<P>Any grommets or anything on the firewall anywyhere??&gt;||||reg||1
Z||000001||jelly2m8||11-24-2001||10:32 PM||||If your car is an automatic, there is a empty hole with a full rubber plug in it.<P> Other than that you can run try and run the wire out thru one of the gromments for the shift cables, or the throttle cable.<P> When I had the carbed engine in my V8, I had a manual choke, and I ran the cable inside the car through one of the gromments with one of the cables. Which one I forget.<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://users.eastlink.ca/~acook1/pegged%2001.jpg"> ||||reg||1
